get {
  url: https://open.er-api.com/v6/latest/INR
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  # Get Currency Rates
  
  Fetches live exchange rates with INR as the base currency.
  Free tier — no API key required.
  
  ## Response Structure
  ```json
  {
    "result": "success",
    "base_code": "INR",
    "rates": {
      "JPY": 1.68,
      "USD": 0.012,
      "EUR": 0.011,
      ...
    },
    "time_last_update_utc": "..."
  }
  ```
  
  ## Usage
  - Multiply the user's INR amount by `rates[target_currency]`
  - e.g., 50000 INR × 1.68 = 84,000 JPY
  
  ## Change Base Currency
  Replace `INR` in the URL with any ISO 4217 currency code.
}
